      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOLICIT (7) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 19.99. Wide box to overcome but goes well over this trip. Great chance to get the job done again. RAIN ABOUT (8) should get a clear run from the wide draw. Safely held last start when a 2.75 lengths 6th at this track (20.44). Has a strong winning record here at this journey including one wins. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. BUNDY BLAZE (2) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage third, beaten 3.5 lengths (20.07) at this track in a Restricted WIN over 366m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Leading player again. ICE RIDER (5) collected a minor prize last start and must be considered.",
